OL,3,GNEWSACar park boarding-up order set to
OL,4,Abe extended
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses are to apply to extend a
OL,7,Fcourt order to keep Leicester's
OL,8,Flandmark Lee Circle car park boarded
OL,9,Fup.
OL,11,FThe multi-storey building was sealed up
OL,12,Fin June in a bid to prevent crime and
OL,13,Fdisorder, including illegal car meets,
OL,14,Fdrug use and fire setting.
OL,16,FThe current order expires in early
OL,17,FSeptember but Leicester City Council
OL,18,Fsaid problems were still occurring at
OL,19,Fthe site.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
