OL,3,GNEWSACar park boarding-up order set to
OL,4,Abe extended
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a result, officials said they want
OL,7,Fto extend the order for a further three
OL,8,Fmonths, as well as widen it to the
OL,9,Fadjacent surface level car park.
